Hypothesis ADDU21 : forall D, PQATSS2a.addu21_spec L ar (HIk D).
Hypothesis ADDU22 : PQATSS2a.addu22_spec L ar HIk LR.
Hypothesis SUBBIG1 : forall D, PQATSS2a.subbig1_spec L ar (HIk D).
Hypothesis SUBBIG2 : PQATSS2a.subbig2_spec L ar HIk LR.
